Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.28,0:00:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Codex Text Control gives a project one editable,\Nauthoritative context instead of another copy buried\Nin chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.58,0:00:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,In a long conversation, requirements become a trail of\Namendments. The latest accepted version is scattered\Nacross earlier messages.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.58,0:00:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,A small table correction is worse. You either describe\Na cell indirectly, or ask for the whole document again\Nand risk unrelated changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The useful boundary is simple. Chat remains the place\Nfor discussion, while the canvas holds only the\Ncontext the user has accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.08,0:00:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Start in the project and ask Codex to open the current\Nauthoritative context canvas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.68,0:00:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Edit the sentence directly. The draft stays in the\Ncanvas while you type, so partial input never becomes\Na saved revision.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:01:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,For a Markdown table, edit the exact cell. Here, only\Nthe review status changes from Needs review to\NConfirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.78,0:01:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,When the visual canvas is not enough, switch to\NMarkdown source and edit the same draft without\Nleaving the workflow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.98,0:01:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish editing opens a final check with the complete\Noriginal text. Nothing is committed merely because\Nthis review opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.88,0:01:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If something is wrong, return to editing. The draft is\Nretained, and the previously accepted revision still\Nremains authoritative.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.98,0:01:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Only Confirm commit writes the snapshot, advances the\Nauthoritative pointer, and sends the new revision ID\Nback to the conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.68,0:01:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The simulated host message shows what returns to the\Nconversation: the new revision ID, not another copy of\Nthe full context.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.08,0:02:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Revision history remains available. Loading an older\Nsnapshot creates a draft, and restoring it still\Nrequires a new confirmation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.98,0:02:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Before the next answer, Codex reads the authoritative\Ncontext again. Revision rev demo zero forty three is\Nnow the accepted source.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.48,0:02:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The source is public under MIT. Seventy four of\Nseventy four product tests and five of five GitHub\NActions jobs passed. Version zero point five point\Neight remains a source candidate.
